WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.990
Our galaxy, from outside.

00:02.699 --> 00:08.934
Nobody has seen the Milky Way from outside: this shape is a model built from measurements made inside it.

00:09.512 --> 00:17.241
It holds between one and four hundred billion stars, and the Sun is one of them, 27 000 light-years from the centre.
